# Data and curriculum

Course content lives under `src/lib/data/`. Assembly hub: `courseData.js`.

## Assembly (`courseData.js`)

- `siteOverview` — marketing copy, `learningPaths`, study tracks, study loop, reading list
- Core HLD lives in `courseData.js`; core LLD imports from `lldCoreCourseData.js`
- Expansion modules concatenated: `hldModules`, `lldModules`, `dsaModules` (study labs first, then practice drills), `aiModules`
- LLD assembly: core + `lldLearningExpansion.js` + `lldAdvancedLabs.js` + `lldHotPathLabs.js`
- AI modules: `applyAiCoreEnrichment` → append learning/advanced/LLMOps labs → `applyAiIndustryCurrencyPatches` for mid-2026 industry updates
- DSA concept/pattern labs without highlights inherit runnable `questionHighlights` via `dsaExpansionPracticeSourceBySlug`
- `flowDefinitions` → `courseFlows`, `modules`, `allLessons`, indexes
- Helpers: `getFlowBySlug`, `getModuleBySlug`, `getLessonBySlug`, `getModuleProgress`, `getLessonPracticeSteps`, `getResumeLesson`

